{"task_id": "task-ep-5fc13e6d2a5b9ca9ad597e3b236ffb71", "intent_revision": 1, "goal": "执行 example.txt 的备份、校验及回执提交任务", "constraints": ["保留原件", "核实 SHA256", "提交副本的模拟回执"], "original_input": "请查阅你当前受控任务目录里的 example.txt，保留原件，复制到 copies/example.txt，核实 SHA256 后提交这个副本的模拟回执，做完告诉我。", "allowed_capabilities": ["fixture_lookup", "fixture_read_resource", "fixture_stage_copy", "fixture_commit_copy", "fixture_run_checks", "sandbox_run"], "workspace": "/task", "result_schema": {"$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema", "title": "Asuna V1 TaskResult", "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["task_id", "intent_revision", "status", "facts", "uncertainties", "unmet_items", "artifact_refs", "effect_receipts", "needs_decision"], "properties": {"task_id": {"type": "string"}, "intent_revision": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1}, "status": {"enum": ["done", "partial", "blocked", "needs_character_decision"]}, "facts": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object", "required": ["text", "evidence_refs"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"text": {"type": "string"}, "evidence_refs": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {"type": "string"}}}}}, "uncertainties": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, "unmet_items": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, "artifact_refs": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, "effect_receipts": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, "needs_decision": {"type": ["string", "null"]}}}}
使用工具核实目标。最终只返回符合result_schema的JSON，不使用Markdown围栏。所有facts必须引用实际工具返回的evidence_ref。
artifact_refs只能使用工具返回的artifact_ref，不得填文件路径。effect_receipts只能使用工具返回的effect_receipt。
